[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7382.39, "timestamp": "02:03:02", "text": "基於他們兩人的這段音樂影片。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7395.83, "timestamp": "02:03:15", "text": "我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7398.629, "timestamp": "02:03:18", "text": "想是的，早上下雨的時候是她，早上下雨的時候她會在這裡，晚上下雨的時候也是她。是的。  嗯，是的。早晨，夜晚。看？  是的。這是它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7407.589, "timestamp": "02:03:27", "text": "夜晚的樣子。  是不是很漂亮？看看那些燈光什麼的。  太酷了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7421.75, "timestamp": "02:03:41", "text": "夜晚的景色是這樣的。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7435.864, "timestamp": "02:03:55", "author": "@everestfujich", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/cGf4x80kyXWdAQCEpiCAT1VX7LnsLDD0GjZXaK-xsp1-Ky9Av7IrQcFxwWsVy873fVtPRn54UQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I see the lunar cycle"}]